<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Emmanuel Arap Bett — Laboratory Technician</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#EAE4D6;
    --panel:#F4EFE4;
    --ink:#20241F;
    --ink-soft:#4A4E45;
    --brass:#8C6A2F;
    --brass-light:#B08F4B;
    --pine:#3A4A3B;
    --rule:rgba(32,36,31,0.16);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Lora', serif;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  ::selection{background:var(--brass-light); color:var(--paper);}

  a{color:inherit;}

  .wrap{
    max-width:760px;
    margin:0 auto;
    padding:0 28px;
  }

  /* ---- Ruler rail: fixed left tick column, the signature element ---- */
  .rail{
    position:fixed;
    left:0; top:0; bottom:0;
    width:34px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    padding:36px 0;
    z-index:5;
  }
  .rail-line{
    position:absolute;
    top:36px; bottom:36px; left:50%;
    width:1px;
    background:var(--rule);
  }
  .rail-tick{
    position:relative;
    width:100%;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:9px;
    letter-spacing:0.05em;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    opacity:0.55;
  }
  .rail-tick::before{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    left:50%; top:50%;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
    width:9px; height:1px;
    background:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  @media (max-width:820px){ .rail{display:none;} }

  header{
    padding:120px 0 90px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:0.18em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--brass);
    margin-bottom:22px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{
    content:'';
    width:22px; height:1px;
    background:var(--brass);
    display:inline-block;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight:500;
    font-size:clamp(40px, 7vw, 68px);
    line-height:1.03;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  h1 em{
    font-style:italic;
    font-weight:400;
    color:var(--pine);
  }
  .role{
    margin-top:20px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:0.06em;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .lede{
    margin-top:30px;
    max-width:54ch;
    font-size:18px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-style:italic;
  }

  section{
    padding:64px 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .sec-head{
    display:flex;
    align-items:baseline;
    justify-content:space-between;
    margin-bottom:36px;
  }
  .sec-title{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:28px;
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .sec-index{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--brass);
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
  }

  .about p{
    max-width:58ch;
    font-size:17px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .entry{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:120px 1fr;
    gap:24px;
    padding:26px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .entry:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .entry-period{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--brass);
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
    padding-top:4px;
  }
  .entry-title{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:500;
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .entry-place{
    font-size:15px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom:10px;
  }
  .entry-desc{
    font-size:15.5px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    max-width:52ch;
  }
  @media (max-width:560px){
    .entry{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:6px;}
  }

  .skills-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill, minmax(190px,1fr));
    gap:1px;
    background:var(--rule);
    border:1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .skill-card{
    background:var(--panel);
    padding:22px 20px;
  }
  .skill-label{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:10px;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--brass);
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }
  .skill-name{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:17px;
  }

  .contact{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:16px 40px;
    align-items:flex-end;
    justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .contact-line{
    font-family:'Fraunces', serif;
    font-size:26px;
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .contact-line a{
    border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--brass);
    padding-bottom:2px;
    text-decoration:none;
    transition:color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .contact-line a:hover{
    color:var(--brass);
  }
  .contact-sub{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
  }

  footer{
    padding:40px 0 60px;
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:11px;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    opacity:0.6;
    letter-spacing:0.04em;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){
    .fade-up{
      opacity:0;
      transform:translateY(14px);
      animation:fadeUp 0.7s ease forwards;
    }
  }
  @keyframes fadeUp{ to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }

  :focus-visible{
    outline:2px solid var(--brass);
    outline-offset:3px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="rail" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="rail-line"></div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow fade-up">Curriculum · Technician's Log</div>
    <h1 class="fade-up">Emmanuel<br><em>Arap&nbsp;Bett</em></h1>
    <div class="role fade-up">Laboratory Technician</div>
    <p class="lede fade-up">A dedicated and reliable professional technician, ready to work precisely within the client's demand.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="about">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="sec-title">About</h2>
      <span class="sec-index">SEC. 01</span>
    </div>
    <p>Emmanuel brings four years of hands-on laboratory experience, with a steady, methodical approach to technical work and a commitment to meeting each client's requirements accurately and reliably.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="sec-title">Experience</h2>
      <span class="sec-index">SEC. 02</span>
    </div>
    <div class="entry">
      <div class="entry-period">4 YRS</div>
      <div>
        <div class="entry-title">Lab Assistant</div>
        <div class="entry-place">Kericho National Polytechnic</div>
        <div class="entry-desc">Supported laboratory operations and technical procedures over a four-year tenure, maintaining accuracy and reliability throughout.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="sec-title">Skills</h2>
      <span class="sec-index">SEC. 03</span>
    </div>
    <div class="skills-grid">
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="skill-label">Approach</div>
        <div class="skill-name">Precision & Care</div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="skill-label">Approach</div>
        <div class="skill-name">Reliability</div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="skill-label">Approach</div>
        <div class="skill-name">Client-Focused Work</div>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-card">
        <div class="skill-label">Setting</div>
        <div class="skill-name">Laboratory Operations</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="sec-title">Contact</h2>
      <span class="sec-index">SEC. 04</span>
    </div>
    <div class="contact">
      <div>
        <div class="contact-line"><a href="mailto:kipkoechbanks@gmail.com">kipkoechbanks@gmail.com</a></div>
        <div class="contact-sub" style="margin-top:10px;">Available on request</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>Emmanuel Arap Bett — Portfolio</footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
